# Distributed callback user throw

[NamedHandler, HandlerRegistry](std/mapreduce/handlers.ssc)

```scalascript
HandlerRegistry.register(NamedHandler("fail", (value: Int) =>
  throw new RuntimeException("distributed-user-boom")
))

val message = try {
  HandlerRegistry.apply("fail", 7)
  "unexpected"
} catch {
  case error: RuntimeException => error.getMessage
}
println(message)
```
